            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; vertical-align: top;"><a href="https://www.irs.gov/individuals/understanding-your-cp504-notice" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0A3D3A; text-decoration: underline;">irs.gov CP504 Notice</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #fff;">
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: #0D2137; vertical-align: top;">IRS Form 12153 — CDP Hearing Request</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: #0D2137; vertical-align: top;">Collection Due Process appeal procedures to pause IRS levy enforcement</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; vertical-align: top;"><a href="https://www.irs.gov/forms-pubs/about-form-12153" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0A3D3A; text-decoration: underline;">Form 12153 Information</a></td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #f6f8fa;">
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: #0D2137; vertical-align: top;">IRS Online Payment Agreement (OPA)</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: #0D2137; vertical-align: top;">Installment Agreement rules to halt CP504 levy actions online</td>
            <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; vertical-align: top;"><a href="https://www.irs.gov/payments/online-payment-agreement-application" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0A3D3A; text-decoration: underline;">irs.gov Online Payment Plan</a></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
