        <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #4B5A6E; margin: 0;">Decode IRS underreporter income mismatch letters and response letter templates.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/retirement-tax-withholding-calculator/" style="display: block; background: #fff; border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.5rem; padding: 1.25rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
